SUMMARY:Downtown Pensacola Holiday Lighting Ceremony
LOCATION:Pensacola Museum of History and Palafox Street\, 309 S Palafox St\
 , Pensacola\, FL 32502
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday 11/4 · Santa photos 3:30 PM to 4:45 PM\, lighting ce
 remony 5:00 PM\n\nDowntown Pensacola kicks off its seven-week holiday seas
 on on Wednesday\, November 4. Santa arrives at the Pensacola Museum of His
 tory at 3:30 PM for photos until 4:45 PM\, and the 5 PM ceremony lights mo
 re than half a million holiday lights along Palafox Street. Winterfest's m
